	quests: [
		{
			dependencies: ["1F08060BC8BCA682"]
			description: ["Hundreds of atoms held in light, swollen to a thousand times their size and made to compute together. The &6Rydberg Array Works&r makes the logic that the imager, the ark and the shell run on. The MAX hull, the optical table casing on atomic casing, a vacuum chamber of strand coils and a tweezer die as research. The Rydberg logic array, which the ark, the imager and the mirror shell all consume. A spent array comes back to be refurbished, so loop it home instead of binning it."]
			icon: "gtceu:rydberg_array_works"
			id: "15D5206E38FE152C"
			rewards: [{ id: "71F3B23D6378C3D4", type: "xp", xp: 120 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [
				{ id: "191FD887DE92A665", item: "gtceu:rydberg_array_works", type: "item" }
				{ id: "501EC86C6B7DE245", item: "grindless:max_optical_table_casing", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "Rydberg Array Works"
			x: 2.5d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["15D5206E38FE152C"]
			description: ["The first array is the hard one. After that, every spent array goes back into the works."]
			icon: "grindless:rydberg_logic_array"
			id: "187F0BA64323CC4D"
			rewards: [{ id: "3705E57B154B2122", type: "xp", xp: 80 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "5700418CFB9EF2B9", item: "grindless:rydberg_logic_array", type: "item" }]
			title: "Rydberg Logic Array"
			x: 5.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1F08060BC8BCA682"]
			description: ["Matter waves on an optical table, split and joined again to weigh gravity itself. The &6Atom Interferometer Works&r makes the gradiometer behind the MAX sensor. The MAX hull and the optical table casing, a tall drop tower with a magnetic shield, and a space of its own, because every footstep shows up as noise. The matter-wave gradiometer, so the MAX sensor, and with it the controllers that want one. Run it from a pattern provider; the gradiometer is the only thing it makes, so a single chest does it."]
			icon: "gtceu:atom_interferometer_works"
			id: "18197070E4168342"
			rewards: [{ id: "1FD4916E59DC8DE4", type: "xp", xp: 120 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [
				{ id: "372F1564FE7FE580", item: "gtceu:atom_interferometer_works", type: "item" }
				{ id: "380F3DD8D1781A4C", item: "grindless:max_optical_table_casing", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "Atom Interferometer Works"
			x: 2.5d
			y: 1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["18197070E4168342"]
			description: ["It measures how steeply gravity falls from one atom to the next. The MAX sensor and the mass stream injector both want one."]
			icon: "grindless:matter_wave_gradiometer"
			id: "5C3E06AA80AB6FA5"
			rewards: [{ id: "3E1414B35D769605", type: "xp", xp: 80 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "1ADE9C829C547922", item: "grindless:matter_wave_gradiometer", type: "item" }]
			title: "Matter-Wave Gradiometer"
			x: 5.0d
			y: 1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1F08060BC8BCA682"]
			description: ["A film one atom thick, rolled, grown and chilled along a long line. The &6Membrane Line&r makes the superconducting membrane that no older machine can. The MAX hull and a long run of roller casings through a CVD zone and a cold zone, with room for the length. The superconducting membrane, the conveyor module, the field generator and the hatches that move fluids. The line is long but quiet: feed it by ME and send the membrane to the ark and the hall."]
			icon: "gtceu:membrane_line"
			id: "3FC8F0795380E0E2"
			rewards: [{ id: "7EA2EE0810C94BD3", type: "xp", xp: 120 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [
				{ id: "5CC2A65DA79BB1EE", item: "gtceu:membrane_line", type: "item" }
				{ id: "30F9C29BD06654CA", item: "grindless:membrane_roller_casing", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "Membrane Line"
			x: 2.5d
			y: 3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3FC8F0795380E0E2"]
			description: ["A skin that carries current with no loss. It shows up in the conveyor, the field generator and the hatches, so make it early."]
			icon: "grindless:superconducting_membrane"
			id: "373D406AA533F310"
			rewards: [{ id: "11762D65DD8EF9D6", type: "xp", xp: 80 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "14E24150467067E5", item: "grindless:superconducting_membrane", type: "item" }]
			title: "Superconducting Membrane"
			x: 5.0d
			y: 3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["187F0BA64323CC4D", "373D406AA533F310"]
			description: ["A library of every genome the pack has met, written to crystal in a sealed cold vault. The &6Gene Ark&r makes the genome archive that goes into the last seed. The MAX hull, a sterilising filter casing vault with a cryogenic core, a Rydberg logic array and a superconducting membrane. The genome archive, which the later gates and MAX+ count on. Genomes arrive by ME; one archive is enough, so cap it."]
			icon: "gtceu:gene_ark"
			id: "77428218C6DD16A7"
			rewards: [{ id: "3C665EF9B591A0A2", type: "xp", xp: 120 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [{ id: "5BC142BB55DB415D", item: "gtceu:gene_ark", type: "item" }]
			title: "Gene Ark"
			x: 7.5d
			y: 1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["77428218C6DD16A7"]
			description: ["What is written there is what the new universe remembers."]
			icon: "grindless:genome_archive"
			id: "5A94EB5921E6E09A"
			rewards: [{ id: "55812DFFDC074197", type: "xp", xp: 80 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "1D453EDF84B7E8AB", item: "grindless:genome_archive", type: "item" }]
			title: "Genome Archive"
			x: 10.0d
			y: 1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["33DDC08F5E410B5F"]
			description: ["It looks at the light that has gone round the hole, and from the ring it reads the spin and charts the cluster. The &6Photon Ring Imager&r is the eye of the whole era. The MAX hull, a ring of dish panels on a truss and a cold core of receivers, built in orbit around Sagittarius A*, with a Rydberg logic array. The spin map and the cluster ephemeris, both on the journey. It works one image at a time, so give it its own array supply and leave it."]
			icon: "gtceu:photon_ring_imager"
			id: "38957F897FD4B1D2"
			rewards: [{ id: "16F3D4B7760A17A4", type: "xp", xp: 120 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [
				{ id: "17159025961C40D2", item: "gtceu:photon_ring_imager", type: "item" }
				{ id: "3B0A0FFA59ED99D3", item: "grindless:max_srf_cavity", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "Photon Ring Imager"
			x: 2.5d
			y: 6.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["33DDC08F5E410B5F"]
			description: ["A tether dropped over the horizon and wound on a drum. The &6Geroch Winch&r takes power from the hole's spin, and wears its tether as it works. The MAX hull, a tall tower of drum casing over a tether well, and spare tethers. The first power the galactic centre gives back. Tethers wear out, so keep a pattern provider on them."]
			icon: "gtceu:geroch_winch"
			id: "110860BEED613414"
			rewards: [{ id: "54C2F1DBAE7BC73C", type: "xp", xp: 150 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [
				{ id: "749A97CBDBB43D9D", item: "gtceu:geroch_winch", type: "item" }
				{ id: "5219A537BCC87714", item: "grindless:geroch_drum_casing", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "Geroch Winch"
			x: 2.5d
			y: 7.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["33DDC08F5E410B5F"]
			description: ["It shapes hot flow into streams, and the streams into bundles. The &6Mass Stream Injector&r holds a shell up with moving mass. The MAX hull, a ring of stream-turn casing round a pellet accelerator, and a matter-wave gradiometer from the atom works at home. The stream bundle, which the mirror shell is built round. Pellets by ME; bundles come out in a chest and go straight to the shell."]
			icon: "gtceu:mass_stream_injector"
			id: "53636F954A3A7FC5"
			rewards: [{ id: "3ED9716592A6BDB8", type: "xp", xp: 120 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [
				{ id: "59859201F927DD25", item: "gtceu:mass_stream_injector", type: "item" }
				{ id: "5C5D3E3560AF4B77", item: "grindless:stream_turn_casing", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "Mass Stream Injector"
			x: 2.5d
			y: 9.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["53636F954A3A7FC5"]
			description: ["Bound to be laid in rings round the shell. Ask for them as the segments go up."]
			icon: "grindless:stream_bundle"
			id: "3D0AE7FBA92319CB"
			rewards: [{ id: "324DA15E6617906D", type: "xp", xp: 80 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "1E7B3F3B53E8E605", item: "grindless:stream_bundle", type: "item" }]
			title: "Stream Bundle"
			x: 5.0d
			y: 9.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["71D59C41930835BE"]
			description: ["It melts belt rock with the concentrated light of the cluster, and heats, separates and casts in one structure. The &6Cluster-Light Furnace&r is the only source of segment truss and stream pellets in quantity. The MAX hull, a bowl of albedo panels over a sinter hearth, built in the belt itself. The silicate slag the feeder burns, and the truss and pellets for the shell. The hearth lining wears, so keep spares; its slag and its volatiles each have somewhere to go."]
			icon: "gtceu:cluster_light_furnace"
			id: "1BF40431DAEF20FB"
			rewards: [{ id: "1EC1B6C316569CDB", type: "xp", xp: 120 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [
				{ id: "1C830E048DD9A4B1", item: "gtceu:cluster_light_furnace", type: "item" }
				{ id: "7E6C59379AB78DB7", item: "grindless:cluster_sinter_casing", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "Cluster-Light Furnace"
			x: 2.5d
			y: 11.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1BF40431DAEF20FB"]
			description: ["What is left of the rock once the iron is out. It is not wasted: it goes to the feeder."]
			icon: "grindless:silicate_slag"
			id: "5D95EF63D1BEB59B"
			rewards: [{ id: "7C96407501148827", type: "xp", xp: 80 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "12E213F3427931F6", item: "grindless:silicate_slag", type: "item" }]
			title: "Silicate Slag"
			x: 5.0d
			y: 11.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5D95EF63D1BEB59B"]
			description: ["Slag spiralling into a hole gives back more of its mass as light than anything else in the pack. The &6Accretion Feeder&r catches that light and turns it into power. The MAX hull, a ring of feeder coil casing with collector panels, and slag pellets from the furnace. The biggest generator of the era, and a use for the slag. It wears its panels and modules as it works: rework them in the solar array fab and the assembler."]
			icon: "gtceu:accretion_feeder"
			id: "700822AA57C7AE85"
			rewards: [{ id: "139AD29C3DE765CC", type: "xp", xp: 150 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [
				{ id: "1EFF1CCFF2C3C087", item: "gtceu:accretion_feeder", type: "item" }
				{ id: "1EE538EDC6A2241B", item: "grindless:feeder_coil_casing", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "Accretion Feeder"
			x: 7.5d
			y: 11.0d
		}
	]
	subtitle: ["Atoms in light, films one atom thick and a library of genomes at home, then a winch, an injector and a furnace at the galactic centre."]
	title: "MAX: Machines"
}
